1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,346
Five things to do in Madagascar.
The last one is unforgettable.

2
00:00:05,566 --> 00:00:09,024
Do go between April and October,
the dry season.

3
00:00:10,544 --> 00:00:13,106
Do take malaria prevention seriously.

4
00:00:14,626 --> 00:00:17,443
Do see the Avenue
of the Baobabs at sunset.

5
00:00:18,963 --> 00:00:21,600
Do hire a local guide
in the national parks.

6
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:28,590
Do hear the indri sing at Andasibe.
Its song carries 2 kilometers.
